// Module
var code = "<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <div id=\"link-to-quiz\" class=\"btn-back\">назад</div>\r\n\r\n  <h1>Fundamentals of the internet</h1>\r\n\r\n  <strong>27 вопросов. Выполнил на 100 баллов из 100</strong>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>1. Can authorized members access intranets and extranets from different physical locations?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Могут ли авторизованные участники получать доступ к интранетам и экстрасетям из разных физических мест</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>No, they have to be at the company's secret lair</li>\r\n    <li>Yes, but only during business hours</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Yes, they can be accessed from different locations</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Only if they have the secret password</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>2. Despite the evolution of its technologies, what remained consistent about the Internet's working?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Несмотря на эволюцию технологий, то, что оставалось неизменным в работе Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Its ability to connect computers and ensure continued connectivity</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Its reliance on a single central server</li>\r\n    <li>Its controlled access to selected organizations</li>\r\n    <li>Its primary role as a data storage mechanism</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>3. How can two computers be connected?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Как можно соединить два компьютера</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Using a carrier pigeon</li>\r\n    <li>Only with a USB cable</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Either physically or wirelessly</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Via satellite link only</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>4. How did the support for the evolution of the Internet into a public infrastructure come about in the 1980s?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Как возникла поддержка превращения Интернета в общественную инфраструктуру в 1980-е годы</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Solely through private companies</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Through a mix of public universities and private companies</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Only through governmental support</li>\r\n    <li>Through international collaborations</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>5. How does an Extranet differ from an Intranet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Чем Экстранет отличается от Интранета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Extranet is an Intranet with extra cheese</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Extranet opens part of a private network to allow collaboration with external organizations</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Extranet doesn't use Internet protocols</li>\r\n    <li>Extranet is a newer version of the Internet</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>6. How is the Web related to the Internet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Как Сеть связана с Интернетом</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>The Web is a larger version of the Internet</li>\r\n    <li>The Web and the Internet are competitors</li>\r\n    <li><strong>The Web is a service built on top of the Internet infrastructure</strong></li>\r\n    <li>The Internet is an app on the Web</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>7. How many cables are required to connect ten computers directly?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Сколько кабелей потребуется для соединения десяти компьютеров напрямую</h3>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>10 cables</li>\r\n    <li>20 cables</li>\r\n    <li><strong>45 cables</strong></li>\r\n    <li>9 cables</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>8. If you have ten computers and a router, how many cables are needed to connect them?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Если у вас десять компьютеров и роутер, сколько кабелей нужно для их соединения</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>9 cables</li>\r\n    <li>20 cables</li>\r\n    <li><strong>10 cables</strong></li>\r\n    <li>45 cables</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>9. In which decade did the Internet evolve into a public infrastructure?</h3>\r\n  <h3>За какое десятилетие Интернет превратился в общественную инфраструктуру</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>1950s</li>\r\n    <li>1960s</li>\r\n    <li>1970s</li>\r\n    <li><strong>1980s</strong></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>10. What allows us to scale a network infinitely?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что позволяет нам бесконечно масштабировать сеть</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Connect computers to smartphones</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connecting computers to routers, then routers to routers</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Using a single router for all computers</li>\r\n    <li>Connect each computer to a satellite</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>11. What does an Internet Service Provider (ISP) manage?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Чем управляет интернет-провайдер (ISP)</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Special routers linked together</strong></li>\r\n    <li>The World Wide Web</li>\r\n    <li>Cables in your house</li>\r\n    <li>Internet speed boosting potions</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>12. What does an IP address identify?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что определяет IP-адрес</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>The brand of the computer</li>\r\n    <li>The age of the computer</li>\r\n    <li><strong>A computer linked to a network</strong></li>\r\n    <li>The color of the computer</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>13. What does 'IP' in 'IP address' stand for?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что означает «IP» в «IP-адресе»</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Intelligent Protocol</li>\r\n    <li>Incredible Pizza</li>\r\n    <li>Instant Pudding</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Internet Protocol</strong></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>14. What does the whole infrastructure of interconnected networks represent?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что представляет собой вся инфраструктура взаимосвязанных сетей</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>A large city</li>\r\n    <li><strong>The Internet</strong></li>\r\n    <li>A single router</li>\r\n    <li>The world's largest spaghetti plate</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>15. What equipment is needed to connect our network to the telephone infrastructure?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какое оборудование необходимо для подключения нашей сети к телефонной инфраструктуре</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>A blender</li>\r\n    <li><strong>A modem</strong></li>\r\n    <li>A toaster</li>\r\n    <li>A router</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>16. What is the relationship between the Internet and the Web?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какова связь между Интернетом и Всемирной паутиной</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>The Web is an alternative to the Internet</li>\r\n    <li>The Web is the technical infrastructure, while the Internet is a service based on the Web</li>\r\n    <li><strong>The Internet acts as the technical backbone for the Web</strong></li>\r\n    <li>The Internet and the Web are competing technologies</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>17. What is the role of a router in a network?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какова роль маршрутизатора в сети</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Boosting internet speed</li>\r\n    <li>Storing data from computers</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Ensuring a message reaches the correct destination computer</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Generating Wi-Fi signals only</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>18. What infrastructure connects your house with anyone in the world?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какая инфраструктура связывает ваш дом с любой точкой мира</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>The postal service</li>\r\n    <li>Telegraph lines</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Telephone infrastructure</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Magic</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>19. What is the fundamental role of the Internet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какова фундаментальная роль Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>A large storage system for data</li>\r\n    <li>A service provided by specific companies to access websites</li>\r\n    <li><strong>A large network of computers that communicate with each other</strong></li>\r\n    <li>A physical infrastructure spanning across continents</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>20. What is the primary objective of the Internet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какова основная цель Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>To store vast amounts of information</li>\r\n    <li><strong>To connect computers and ensure they remain connected regardless of circumstances</strong></li>\r\n    <li>To provide entertainment to users</li>\r\n    <li>To secure data from external threats</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>21. What is the primary purpose of an Intranet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какова основная цель интранета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>A public website for promoting products</li>\r\n    <li><strong>A private network restricted to members of an organization</strong></li>\r\n    <li>A platform to decide where to have lunch</li>\r\n    <li>A public network open to all users globally</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>22. When did the inception of the Internet occur?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Когда произошло появление Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>1950s</li>\r\n    <li><strong>1960s</strong></li>\r\n    <li>1970s</li>\r\n    <li>1980s</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>23. Which entity initially funded the research for the Internet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Какая организация первоначально финансировала исследование для Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>European Space Agency</li>\r\n    <li><strong>US Army</strong></li>\r\n    <li>British Intelligence</li>\r\n    <li>United Nations</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>24. Which of the following is NOT a service built on top of the Internet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что из перечисленного НЕ является услугой, созданной на основе Интернета</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Online gaming</li>\r\n    <li>IRC</li>\r\n    <li>Email</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Television</strong></li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>25. Which of the following might you find on an organization's intranet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Что из следующего можно найти во внутренней сети организации</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>An archive of all office memes</li>\r\n    <li>Discussion boards for global users</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Web pages for sharing departmental information</strong></li>\r\n    <li>Public user signup forms</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>26. Why do we use domain names?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Почему мы используем доменные имена</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Because they look fancy</li>\r\n    <li><strong>To make it easier to remember than IP addresses</strong></li>\r\n    <li>To increase the Internet speed</li>\r\n    <li>To hide the actual IP address</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n\r\n\r\n<article class=\"article\">\r\n  <h3>27. Why might a business use an Extranet?</h3>\r\n  <h3>Зачем бизнесу использовать Экстранет</h3>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>To host virtual dance parties</li>\r\n    <li><strong>To share information securely with external stakeholders</strong></li>\r\n    <li>To provide global news updates</li>\r\n    <li>To sell products to the general public</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</article>\r\n";
// Exports
/* harmony default export */ __webpack_exports__["default"] = (code);

